      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepAgents is an agent harness built with LangChain and LangGraph that enables AI systems to tackle complex, multi-step tasks through structured planning and execution. Its key innovation lies in using a planning tool and filesystem backend to break down problems into manageable sub-tasks, which can be delegated to specialized subagents. Developers can use it to build sophisticated AI assistants for research automation, data analysis pipelines, or workflow orchestration by defining custom agent roles and task hierarchies.",
        "zh": "DeepAgents是一个基于LangChain和LangGraph构建的智能体框架，专门解决需要多步骤规划和执行的复杂AI任务。它通过内置的规划工具和文件系统后端，将复杂问题分解为可管理的子任务，并能够动态创建专门化的子智能体进行协同处理。这种分层架构让开发者能够构建研究助手、数据分析流水线或工作流协调系统，通过定义不同的智能体角色和任务层级来实现灵活的任务自动化。",
        "es": "DeepAgents is an agent harness built with LangChain and LangGraph that enables AI systems to tackle complex, multi-step tasks through structured planning and execution. Its key innovation lies in using a planning tool and filesystem backend to break down problems into manageable sub-tasks, which can be delegated to specialized subagents. Developers can use it to build sophisticated AI assistants for research automation, data analysis pipelines, or workflow orchestration by defining custom agent roles and task hierarchies.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "deepagents stands out for ai, deepagents, and langchain in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepAgents is an agent harness built with LangChain and LangGraph that enables AI systems to tackle complex, multi-step tasks through structured planning and execution. Its key innovation lies in using a planning tool and filesystem backend to break down problems into manageable sub-tasks, which can be delegated to specialized subagents. Developers can use it to build sophisticated AI assistants for research automation, data analysis pipelines, or workflow orchestration by defining custom agent roles and task hierarchies.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
