      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claudian is an Obsidian plugin that integrates Claude Code as an AI collaborator directly within your knowledge vault, addressing the need for seamless AI assistance during note-taking and research workflows. It works by embedding Claude's coding capabilities into Obsidian's interface, allowing real-time code generation and explanation without switching applications. Users can install it via Obsidian's community plugins, then invoke Claude Code through commands or hotkeys to get coding help, debug scripts, or generate documentation while maintaining their workflow context.",
        "zh": "Claudian 是一款 Obsidian 插件，将 Claude Code 作为 AI 协作者嵌入知识库中，解决了在笔记和研究过程中需要频繁切换工具获取编程帮助的问题。它通过 TypeScript 实现深度集成，让用户能在 Obsidian 界面内直接调用 Claude 的代码生成与解释功能，保持工作流连贯性。使用时只需通过社区插件安装，即可用快捷键或命令唤出 Claude Code，实时获得代码建议、调试脚本或生成文档，特别适合开发者、研究者和技术写作者在构建知识体系时同步进行编程实践。",
        "es": "Claudian is an Obsidian plugin that integrates Claude Code as an AI collaborator directly within your knowledge vault, addressing the need for seamless AI assistance during note-taking and research workflows. It works by embedding Claude's coding capabilities into Obsidian's interface, allowing real-time code generation and explanation without switching applications. Users can install it via Obsidian's community plugins, then invoke Claude Code through commands or hotkeys to get coding help, debug scripts, or generate documentation while maintaining their workflow context.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claudian stands out for claude-code, ide, and obsidian in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Claudian is an Obsidian plugin that integrates Claude Code as an AI collaborator directly within your knowledge vault, addressing the need for seamless AI assistance during note-taking and research workflows. It works by embedding Claude's coding capabilities into Obsidian's interface, allowing real-time code generation and explanation without switching applications. Users can install it via Obsidian's community plugins, then invoke Claude Code through commands or hotkeys to get coding help, debug scripts, or generate documentation while maintaining their workflow context.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/YishenTu/claudian for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
